# Frontend (Vite) — copy to .env only if you need to override the default.
#
# There is no committed .env here on purpose. src/api/http.ts already falls back to "/api" when
# this variable is unset, and .dockerignore excludes .env from the image, so the container build
# has always used that fallback. A committed .env holding the same value as the default did
# nothing except sit in the repository matching the `*.env` rule in .gitignore — the same shape of
# inconsistency that let .env stay tracked unnoticed.
#
# "/api" = same-origin ผ่าน proxy (vite dev proxy / nginx ใน prod)
# เปลี่ยนเป็น URL เต็มได้ถ้าต้องการเรียก backend ต่าง host โดยตรง
VITE_BACKEND_URL=/api
